        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-08-13T22:13:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s just call make this \"Email string\" and don\u0027t mention the URI part or the \"mailto:\" part:\n\n   // Email optionally specifies a contact email address.\n   // This is used by CAs (such as LetsEncrypt.org) to notify you\n   // if there are problems with your certificates.\n   Email string\n\nIf we need to add \"Contacts []string\" later, we can. But let\u0027s start with just the common case.",
      "revId": "0c3b50398588ef127faada1e8521bc5bf192a26a",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
